[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9722.71, "timestamp": "02:42:02", "text": "留学吗？是的，呃，先上两年语言课，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9724.63, "timestamp": "02:42:04", "text": "然后我会去那里上大学什么的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9730.15, "timestamp": "02:42:10", "text": "我不知道我能不能回家，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9732.71, "timestamp": "02:42:12", "text": "我只知道我的语言学校不会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9737.27, "timestamp": "02:42:17", "text": "允许我回去，除非有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9744.07, "timestamp": "02:42:24", "text": "校长的特别许可。 非常严格。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9748.389, "timestamp": "02:42:28", "text": "所以我必须保持100%的出勤率。   像这样的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 9755.072, "timestamp": "02:42:35", "author": "@DinyoFoxy", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/aACLJToYP6FMtiMkCyV12FJchjJLrwy1qzEVqHiZEyFaZdsbRkj-yqg_i_m8eqjYX-fTLgPLCzk=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "you going alone ?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9759.75, "timestamp": "02:42:39", "text": "你经常去的那种超级严格的学校，我和一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9761.83, "timestamp": "02:42:41", "text": "同学一起"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9771.03, "timestamp": "02:42:51", "text": "在印度当地的一所语言学校学习，也会有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9774.309, "timestamp": "02:42:54", "text": "其他学生也"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9775.99, "timestamp": "02:42:55", "text": "去同一所学校"}]